1
00:00:05,271 --> 00:00:06,361
(Bernadette:)What you doing?

2
00:00:06,539 --> 00:00:09,529
You said clean up. I'm cleaning up, heh.

3
00:00:11,177 --> 00:00:13,307
(Bernadette:)You can't just throw everything
in the closet.

4
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:16,470
(Howard:)You can tell me what to do
or you can tell me how to do it...

5
00:00:16,649 --> 00:00:19,849
(Howard:)...but you can't do both.
This isn't sex.

6
00:00:21,888 --> 00:00:23,648
Well, what if someone looks in there?

7
00:00:23,823 --> 00:00:26,723
They're coming over for dinner,
no one will look in the closet.

8
00:00:26,926 --> 00:00:30,196
(Bernadette:)You don't know that. What if someone's
looking for the bathroom?

9
00:00:30,363 --> 00:00:31,383
It could work out.

10
00:00:31,564 --> 00:00:34,504
(Howard:)For all we know,
there's a toilet in there somewhere.

11
00:00:35,835 --> 00:00:38,495
Fine. After tonight,
we need to get a handle on this mess.

12
00:00:38,671 --> 00:00:40,701
(Howard:)We should show the closet to Sheldon.

13
00:00:40,874 --> 00:00:42,174
(Bernadette:)Why?

14
00:00:42,342 --> 00:00:44,832
Ha. Are you kidding?
He's like a savant at organizing.

15
00:00:45,011 --> 00:00:47,211
(Howard:)Everything in his apartment
has a label on it...

16
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:51,250
(Howard:)...including his label maker,
which has a label that says "label maker."

17
00:00:52,385 --> 00:00:56,845
If you look really close at that label-maker
label, you'll see a label that says "label."

18
00:00:57,724 --> 00:01:00,754
No, he's our guest. We can't ask him
to straighten our closet.

19
00:01:00,927 --> 00:01:02,797
(Howard:)No, we wouldn't ask him.

